WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:04.730
It's another three weeks until the Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix.

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:09.570
And Mega-nii said they still haven't found any clues about Phantom Thief Genius.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.050
So irritating!

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:15.370
He came out of absolutely no where and made a mockery out of us.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.870
Where do you think he is?

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.870
Being friends isn't a bad thing.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.790
Yeah! Friends are the best!

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:30.000
When it comes time, we'll just have to show him how strong our friendship is!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.880
Agreed!

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.080
That's true.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:37.140
Even though we're rivals, it's different when it comes to taking down that phantom thief.

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:42.170
Let's use our friendship power to hold him and and I'll deliver the final blow!

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:43.560
Go!

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:46.750
Why soccer?

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:47.730
Ouch!

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:51.230
Huh?

00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:54.240
24.5?

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:57.990
Ah! I just got a great idea!

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:02.190
What do you think about doing a special on PriPara TV?

00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:02.750
Huh?

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:07.250
And it's name will be "24.5 Hour Television"!

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.300
"24.5 Hour Television"?

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.750
Capisce!

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:15.020
You've got some big feet there, Shion.

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:15.970
Go?!

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:50.940
Friend Tickets Save the World!

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:55.900
24.5 Hour Television: Friends Save PriPara!

00:02:55.900 --> 00:02:57.820
It's starting!

00:02:58.160 --> 00:02:59.690
Nice festival!

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:02.140
This is the stylish tough guy, Mega-nii.

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:06.790
Make sure to keep your eyes focused on me for the entire 24.5 hours.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:11.290
Additionally, these six are going to attempt to set a big record.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:12.570
That's right!

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:16.590
We want to snap Friend Tickets with one million people!

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:20.550
This is the 24.5 Hour One Million Friend Ticket Snapping Challenge!

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.740
Friend Tickets are a symbol of friendship!

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.350
And we'd like to prove it!

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:26.810
And we can achieve it with your help!

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.520
We'd love your assistance-pri!

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:32.220
This "24.5 Hour Television" sounds interesting!

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:34.020
I'm going to go snap with them!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.220
President Minami is doing her best!

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:40.280
Yet, is watching over her like this
the only thing I can do?

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.920
No, that is not all!

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:45.670
I'm going to run 373 kilometres!

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:48.200
For the passion I have for President Minami in my heart!

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:51.620
Love will save PriPara!

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:53.510
Wow!

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:55.460
There's already this many people here!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.960
Don't push or shove!

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:59.420
Don't rush. We'll make sure to snap with everyone!

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:07.810
We'll take the the snapped Friend Tickets,

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.930
and attach them one by one to the side of the building.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.120
Once one million people have come through,

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.410
the friend tickets will create some sort of spectacular miracle.

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.730
Please look forward to it.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:19.240
Amazing-kuma!

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:22.530
90% of the world population is watching-kuma!

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:26.780
They're also receiving batch after batch of Friend Tickets from around the globe-usa!

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:30.240
One million's going to be a piece of cake-kuma!

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:31.320
One million Friend Tickets sure is a lot!

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.470
Snap with one million people, huh?

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:33.530
She's still going on about that friendship crap.

00:04:33.530 --> 00:04:38.030
With everyone's help, I wonder if we'll reach around the world.

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:38.880
Oh well.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:42.590
We'll see once I find my next candidate.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:46.920
Who will be the princess that shall bring a beautiful revolution to PriPara?

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:48.280
For our first segment,

00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:50.050
PriPara's number one pop idol is coming out.

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:51.060
Pop?!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:55.020
The Let's Apply Pri to the End of Mirei's Sentences Show-pri!

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:56.710
An idol without a  sentence ender....

00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:01.250
...is like oden without chikuwa in it-pri!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.600
Pri is the world! The world is Pri!

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:06.050
Pri does not make Pri better than other Pri.

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:08.910
Pri of the Pri by the Pri, for the Pri-pri.

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:13.170
And here is the one who has the troubled sentence ender we'll be consoling today-pri!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:19.750
All right, panellists, what sentence ender would you suggest for this troubled PriPara idol-pri?

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:22.040
I got it!

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:25.270
"Good morning!" shortened to "Go'morn!"

00:05:25.270 --> 00:05:27.320
Tension high socks!

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.980
"Time to eat" shortened to "Nom nom"!

00:05:29.980 --> 00:05:31.630
Kyupikon!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:34.680
"Giant salamander" shortened to "Salagrander!"

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:35.630
Pri!

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:38.000
Take this seriously-pri!

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:38.650
I'm pri'd off-pri!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.820
Sentence enders are poisonous.
I'm pri'd off-pri!

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:45.110
Mirei's pri is especially poisonous.

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:48.070
Guess Mirei will have to come up with one-pri.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:52.290
Come on down, new natural sentence ender idol!

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:55.710
I'm Fuwari.

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:58.170
I'll say my natural sentence ender.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.130
Hello-natu.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.050
Andou...

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:06.510
I hope you liked it-natu.

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:11.330
That's quite a splendid sentence ender-pri.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:13.430
Hooray for idols with sentence enders-pri!

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:15.080
I also want a sentence ender!

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.200
Kyupikon!

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.890
Stop! Stop the cameras-kuma!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:19.570
Pri?

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:20.350
Natu?

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.900
The complaint hotline has been flooded-kuma!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:23.860
What?!

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:25.820
Stop the sentence ender segment!

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.000
Fuwari has no need for a sentence ender!

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.450
Mirei should pipe down.

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:32.180
I hate her "pri"! It gives me goosebumps!

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:39.790
We are incredibly sorry.

00:06:39.790 --> 00:06:40.950
Please accept our apology.

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.000
The lines are blowing up-kuma!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.500
Put an end to it-kuma!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:46.010
E-Everyone, settle down-pr-

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:49.970
Please stay tuned-chanko.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:50.550
Huh?

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:51.120
What's going on?

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.930
It was finally getting interesting.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:53.990
How disappointing.

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:56.520
Ack! There's fewer people in line!

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:57.480
Pri!

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.510
Don't worry!

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:01.190
Next up is my special live drama.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.870
Dorothy West's Special Drama...

00:07:03.870 --> 00:07:05.420
...starts now!

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:10.660
I'm Dorothy, the owner of a okonomiyaki restaurant.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:14.030
However, this is only my alter ego..

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:14.990
But in reality...!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.290
Uh-oh, a situation has developed!

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:20.710
Change!

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:28.560
Tension Max!

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:30.530
Pickled ginger is the one!

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:32.030
Your ninja ally,

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:33.680
Monja Man!

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.270
Help me, Monja Man!

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.060
There's a suspicious individual over there!

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.350
No way.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.050
I'm an ally to ninjas.

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:41.230
No way!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.980
Monja Man, save me!

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.060
Since you're a ninja, sure thing!

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:51.780
Good afternoon, I'm the mysterious Kurageera.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.280
The mysterious Kurageera has made her appearance!

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:56.280
Yes! Go get them!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:58.990
Pushuu!

00:07:58.990 --> 00:07:59.940
Eat this!

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.960
Green laver beam!

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:03.920
Pushuu!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.160
Finishing move!

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:07.900
Bonito Flakes Kick!

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.120
Let me explain.

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:14.930
Bonito Flakes Kick is taken from how it hurts to get hit by bonito flakes that haven't been shaven yet.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:16.390
Eat this!

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:18.470
Red Flash!

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.930
Sour!

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:26.510
I won't lose!

00:08:26.510 --> 00:08:29.480
Not until I conquer this planet...!

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:33.320
Crap! Monja Man has gone to the dark side!

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.400
Stop this pointless story!

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:41.700
You have to comply! There are broadcasting ethics!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:44.710
Please stay tuned-chanko.

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:48.170
Gloomy PriPara 3!

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:50.370
Here are our guests for today!

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:51.920
Alomageddon!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:56.450
Let us introduce to you the gloomiest part of PriPara Town!

00:08:56.450 --> 00:09:01.200
I actually want to guide you to the 4th district of hell, but this will suffice.

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:05.180
This is an ever so gloomy spot.

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:06.600
Its name is UnderPri.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.440
Hello and welcome-nekon.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:12.760
Wow, it's a super cozy bar.

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:13.820
It's peaceful.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.280
What should I have?

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:18.880
I shall dine on the curry udon.

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:19.740
Same here!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:20.570
Hm...

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:21.820
Curry udon...

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:24.510
If you make that into a 4-word idiom, it would be "I will follow along".

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.540
So same here!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:27.540
Wow!

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.210
It looks delicious!

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:30.420
Don't!

00:09:36.410 --> 00:09:38.260
Thanks for the food!

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.220
Ack!

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:40.180
Go!

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:41.600
Neat!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.640
This polka dot curry pattern is cute!

00:09:47.060 --> 00:09:48.260
Devi!

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:50.360
Everyone can do the same!

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.610
I was ill prepared.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.070
See you next time.

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:58.490
It seems like there are even fewer than earlier!

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:01.830
If it continues like this, we might not get to snap with one million people.

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:05.790
And this is on top of the flood of weird complaints that were phoned in-pri.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:06.610
Girls.

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:07.440
Huh?

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.250
It's time to head to bed.

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.020
Please make your way to the sleepover room.

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:11.750
Eh?!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.890
Good girls mustn't stay up.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:16.660
To put it simply, it's the system.

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:18.530
Don't worry-kuma!
Don't worry-usa!

00:10:18.530 --> 00:10:21.300
Leave the late night programming to us-kuma.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:25.810
We'll get the crowd brimming with laughter and completely capture their hearts-usa.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:26.910
Eh?

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:28.690
Will you really be okay?

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.150
Just look forward to coming back in the morning-kuma.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:34.330
Good night.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:39.570
500,000th Friend Ticket exchange...

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:48.500
500,001st, 500,002nd, 500,003rd, 500,004th...

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:55.140
1,000,000,002,840th, 1,000,000,002,841st...

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.630
Wait, huh?

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.380
I passed one million?

00:10:58.910 --> 00:11:01.220
Lala, you didn't fall asleep-pri?

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.850
Cock-a-doodle-doo.

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:08.060
Oh no! PriPara TV's viewership has plummeted!

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:10.940
That means there's only 10 people watching in the entire world!

00:11:10.940 --> 00:11:12.900
What?!

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:26.830
There's not a single fan in the venue.

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:28.730
How sallow.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:29.720
No way!

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:30.580
Why?!

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:32.120
What the heck, you two!

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:34.290
Your segment must have been worthless-pri!

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:36.920
Of course it wasn't-kuma!

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.050
We recorded it, so you can look for yourselves-usa!

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:42.860
The Love of Kuma and Usagi.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:47.070
I was once acquainted with this guy,

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:49.650
but when I spilled carrot juice on the floor, he called it a waste,

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:51.930
and licked it up.

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:53.230
How disgusting-kuma!

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:54.700
Usa!

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:56.750
There was this guy I was once acquainted with,

00:11:56.750 --> 00:12:00.310
but he would drink too much veggie juice before bed and end up wetting the bed.

00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:01.610
It was hilarious!

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:02.430
What?!

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:04.540
How dare you reveal that secret!

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:06.010
You started it-usa!

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:07.760
What's with this poor mascot?!

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:09.660
Shut it, you sleezeball!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:13.120
Please stay tuned-chanko.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:15.180
The Toriko-sama of Entertainment!

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.430
I am the Toriko of Misfortune.

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:22.530
I thought that was a stalk sticking up,

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:24.800
but it was really a long nail-tori!

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:28.260
Please stay tuned-chanko.

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:31.460
Gloria Blows the Competition Away!

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.360
Let's go!

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:33.180
Out!

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:34.270
Safe!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.230
Guroro, guro!

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:39.880
You lost once again, Rina-chan!

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:42.650
Okay, let's do it again and again.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:46.140
Please stay tuned-chanko.

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:47.760
There!

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:50.040
We covered all the bases of late night TV.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:50.580
Usa.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.610
How is that the pinnacle of late night TV, you incompetent mascots?!

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:54.540
Kuma!
Usa!

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:58.000
Pa pi pu pe po!

00:12:58.770 --> 00:12:59.890
We shouldn't have gone to bed!

00:12:59.890 --> 00:13:03.380
With the way things are going, our snapping Friend Tickets with one million people is in a perilous situation.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.470
We just have to regain our power-pri!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:09.430
Houjou Sophie's Heartfelt Communication!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:12.040
I'll open communication with an alien.

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.930
Ring... ring...

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:16.850
Leona West's Daily Weather Forecast.

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:19.890
Today's weather... um...

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:21.750
I think it'll be clear out,

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:23.690
but there's a chance of rain or snow...

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:26.510
Lala's Super Magic Show!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:29.100
I'll escape from this in an instant!

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.840
Capisce power!

00:13:30.840 --> 00:13:32.430
Ack!

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:33.660
Someone help me!

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:36.620
Our ratings keep sliding-kuma!

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:39.130
There's only one more watching-usa!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:45.090
If your viewership drops to zero, "24.5 Hour Television" will be taken off the air at that moment.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.550
Kuma!
Usa!

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.900
Taken off the air?!

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:50.260
Even though we've only gathered this many Friend Tickets?!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.470
That's totally uncool-pri!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:56.230
It's your fault that this started to happen from the very beginning!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.410
No it's not-pri!

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.940
It's because your drama was so boring, Dorothy-pri!

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:03.400
That's because Sophie didn't do her job correctly!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:06.400
Don't push the blame on our Sophie-pri!

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.290
Huh?

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:10.370
Girls...

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:15.490
If we stick kelp up in the place of Friend Tickets, it might just work out...

00:14:15.490 --> 00:14:16.580
As if!

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:19.360
How about mochi wrapped in oak leaves?

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:22.320
This shall turn the tables!

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.360
I'll cover the spaces!

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:25.760
Panda!

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.680
I'm just going to destroy the wall!

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:32.380
Ack! Don't do that, Dorothy!

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:34.640
They're out of control already-pri.
Ack! Don't do that, Dorothy!

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:38.600
And this is the what remains of that so called friendship.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:43.320
There must be something wrong with me for being the last one watching.

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:44.490
Hold on!

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.730
This isn't the end!

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:49.280
I don't want it to end!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.740
Lala...

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:55.200
I mean, I haven't become one with all of you!

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.980
I want to keep going!

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:58.780
Even if our programme gets cancelled,

00:14:58.780 --> 00:15:01.670
let's continue until our hearts are united...

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:05.630
...and until this wall becomes filled with Friend Tickets!

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:07.840
Lala...

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:10.340
It might take time,

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.300
but let's do our best!

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:15.490
A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single walk!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.680
Lala, you're a moron!

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:20.230
Make up your mind on either a good story or being stupid!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:22.980
Huh? Did I mess up?

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:27.040
But it's just as Lala said-pri.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:27.750
Yeah.

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:32.950
The programme's probably not going well because our hearts aren't united.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:36.750
I suppose if the six of us are disconnected we won't be able to snap with one million people.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:37.540
Yeah.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.000
Girls!

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:42.230
That means even if we get complaints, we won't worry about them-pri-pri-pri!

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:43.460
I'll pri without a care-pri!

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:46.200
Let us help you.

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:49.410
Only we know of the exit from hell.

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:52.400
Aloma said she'll also lend her help.

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:53.430
You didn't have to say that!

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:56.040
The demon has turned red.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.390
I'm just cheering you on!

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:58.890
Thanks!

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.310
Falulu will help too!

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:03.770
Falulu!

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:04.810
All right!

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.600
With our friendship power,

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:08.180
let's put on an energising concert!

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:08.980
Yeah!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:12.950
And I've prepared the pre-pre-prettiest coord for it-pri!

00:16:13.260 --> 00:16:14.410
Capisce!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:21.710
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:24.580
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:28.650
Coord Change Start!

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:36.350
The preparations that Mirei-chan made include a new colour for the superior poppin' clown series.

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:39.250
Baby Pink Clown Coord!

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:40.350
Go!

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:47.270
The tops and skirts are completely covered in spangles making it glitter and sparkle!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:49.440
Banana Yellow Clown Coord!

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:50.360
Pri!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:51.110
Yeah!

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:55.360
Everyone loves the polka dots and stripes.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.140
A greedy coord packed with lots of both.

00:16:58.140 --> 00:17:00.690
French Lime Clown Coord!

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:07.540
Oh? Is that SoLaMi Dressing?

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.440
They're singing "Realize!"?!

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:10.750
Oh?

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:12.620
I love that song!

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:28.790
Making Drama Switch On!

00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:52.260
Speeding into the future!

00:18:52.260 --> 00:18:54.570
We are PriPara!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.910
Our viewers are back-kuma!
Our viewers are back-usa!

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:10.930
Cyalume Change!

00:20:04.850 --> 00:20:06.810
One million!

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:11.230
Complete!

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:14.920
Wow!

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:17.150
Congratulations.

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:19.800
Just like I said in the beginning,

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:23.360
if you snap with one million people, the Friend Tickets will create a miracle.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.300
So without further ado,

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:27.830
let's miracle!

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:33.250
What?!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.900
When it seems like the connection with your friends is falling apart,

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:39.180
please remember my smile.

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:42.350
If you do that, I'm sure a wonderful feeling will wash over you,

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:44.360
and your hearts will become one.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.220
This was the miracle...?

00:20:47.610 --> 00:20:50.170
In that case, I'll also create a miracle!

00:20:50.170 --> 00:20:50.930
Pri?

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:55.400
I'll do the knock over ten million Friend Ticket domino challenge!

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.650
That's enough!

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:57.890
Oh well.

00:20:57.890 --> 00:21:00.230
See you next year.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:01.610
Chanko!

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:09.030
One thing has been made clear.

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:12.050
Manaka Lala...

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:13.870
This one's the dumbest of all!

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:16.760
A complete idiot!

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:20.590
In the end, I wasn't able to find the next princess.

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:22.640
No bother.

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:24.880
There's no need to rush.

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:33.530
I must deliver these feelings... to President Minami!

00:22:59.650 --> 00:23:01.420
Pri...

00:23:05.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Mega-nii has made a request to the PriPara Police to investigate the incident-pri.

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:12.400
Who makes up the PriPara Police?

00:23:12.400 --> 00:23:13.780
Da Vinci!

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:16.470
Next time: Ham and Ajimi.

00:23:16.470 --> 00:23:17.760
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:17.760 --> 00:23:20.380
Let's go PriPara!
